      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability — clearer variable names, descriptive assertion messages, and logical structure.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version improves understandability by renaming `actual` to `result`, adding inline comments that explain the fill range semantics (inclusive `fromIndex`, exclusive `toIndex`), and adding descriptive assertion messages that clarify why each element is expected to be unchanged or filled."
